Consider the leisure part of the utility function:
$$ - \alpha  rac{n^{1 +  rac{1}{
u}}}{1 +  rac{1}{
u}}$$
We can rewrite it like this:
$$ - (\alpha^{ rac{1}{1 +  rac{1}{
u}}})^{1 +  rac{1}{
